Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.4 03/15] igb: Fix WARN_ONCE on runtime suspend
Date:   Wed, 24 Apr 2019 10:51:40 -0400
Message-Id: <20190424145152.31351-3-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.19.1
In-Reply-To: <20190424145152.31351-1-sashal@kernel.org>
